  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_tiger",
      "name": {
        "en": "Indra's Badge",
        "zh": "因陀罗证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_tiger",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Indra has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for asserting the advantage in close-quarters combat.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Guard Operator during field operations to exercise Fighter responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员因陀罗擅长在近身格斗中取得优势\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为近卫干员，行使斗士职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_tiger",
      "name": {
        "en": "'Hannah's Dislocation Rehabilitation Set'",
        "zh": "“汉娜的脱臼复位套装”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "Y",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_tiger",
      "description": {
        "en": "Keep a steady form, and control your pace. This is what the leader of Norport Borough's gang would tell herself. Indra could barely keep herself conscious, but she used all her will to keep herself together and face the enemy head-on. Here, at the decisive moment, all she ought to need was one more jab.\n'You still want to go?' The calm voice of the opposing party was nearly drowned out by the sound of her own heavy gasps for air.\nLoose silver hairs drooped down across her forehead, blocking her vision and blurring out the golden figure standing firm before her, illuminated by a streetlamp. 'Don't be so quick to call yourself the winner, you little shite! I ain't lost yet!' Indra adjusts her breathing and secretly shifts her center of gravity to behind her left hip, all while gathering her hair firmly behind her shoulders. She raises her fists and clenches her fingers, gripping her shabby brass knuckles even tighter than ever before.\n'I'll help you remember, outsider. This here street's mine—Indra of the Glasgow Gang!' As soon as the words were out of her mouth, the silver figure suddenly steps forward, pouncing upon her opponent faster than the eye could see. She lifts her left fist as if putting every last ounce of strength into this one strike, but then commands her body to turn and instead funnel all that strength into her right fist.\nIndra hears the golden-haired girl mutter in her ear: 'I'll remember alright, Indra of the Glasgow Gang.' A tranquil voice, as she always was. Indra still remembers that after, she lost her balance, she fully expected the cold embrace of the cement road, but that hard sensation looming large in her imagination never came. Through closed eyes, it was like she had... fallen onto a ball of sunshine.\n'Run? Run from what? Sorry Vina, I was daydreaming a bit, didn't hear ya.'\n'How to Fight with the Glasgow Gang. This was your work, wasn't it? Rule Number Four, and this is the most important rule: When it comes time to run, remember to run.'\n'Ah, yeah! Pretty much sums up every street fight I've gotten into over the years.'\n'That night we first met, why didn't you run?'\n'Gonna have to have a think on that one.' Indra lowers her head and contemplates for a moment. 'Back then, whenever we ran from a fight, it was so we could survive. For scroungers on the street, nothing's more important'n staying alive. But...'\n'But?' Siege sits up, facing herself towards Indra.\nIndra raises her head, looking right back at Siege. Under the flickering lights of the boxing gym, two pairs of golden eyes face each other, and she sees herself reflected in the Aslan's eyes.\n'But there's no Feline who doesn't like some time under the sun, right?' Indra draws back the corners of her mouth, impishly baring an ivory grin.",
        "zh": "稳住身形，控制步伐，诺伯特区的帮派领袖这样告诉自己。因陀罗此时已经无法保持清醒，但还是强撑着身体，摆出迎战的架势。快要分出胜负了，应该就是下一击。\n“还要打吗？”对方那平稳的声音几乎要被自己粗重的喘息声掩盖。\n披散的银发从额头上垂落下来，遮挡了视线，也让眼前那道坚定的金色人影在街灯的照耀下变得更加模糊。“别摆出一副赢家的嘴脸，小个子，老子可还没输呢！”因陀罗一边调整呼吸，暗暗地把身体的重心移到靠后的左腿上，一边拢起长发放到肩后。她抬起拳头，勾了勾手指，把破旧的指虎更用力地攥进手里。\n“外面来的，你给我记住。这个街区都是老子——格拉斯哥帮的因陀罗罩着！”话音刚落，银色的身影猛地蹬地，几乎是瞬间就扑到了对方面前。她抬起左拳，看似用尽了全力打出这一击，但却借着发力扭转身体，把所有的力量聚集在了稍后才到的右拳上。\n因陀罗听到了金发女孩在她耳边的低语：“嗯，格拉斯哥帮的因陀罗，我记住了。”一如既往平静的声音。因陀罗还记得，失去平衡后，她原以为自己会狠狠摔在冰冷的水泥路面上，但想象中坚硬的触感并没有如期而至，闭着眼睛的她就像是……跌入了一团阳光里。\n“跑？跑什么？对不起，维娜……我刚才走神了没听清。”\n“格拉斯哥帮战斗指南。这是你之前总结的，对吧？第四条，也是最重要的一条：该跑的时候记得跑。”\n“对！那可是老子这么多年来街头干架的经验总结。”\n“我们第一次相遇的时候。那天晚上，你怎么不跑？”\n“嗯，这我要好好想想。”因陀罗低下头，沉思了一会儿，“在以前，干架的时候逃跑说到底都是为了保命。在街头讨饭吃，保住小命可是排在第一位的事情。但是……”\n“但是？”推进之王坐了起来，看向因陀罗。\n因陀罗抬起头来，注视着推进之王。拳馆里的灯光闪烁着，两双金色的瞳孔对视，她在阿斯兰的眼睛中看见了自己。\n“但没有菲林不喜欢晒太阳，对吧？”因陀罗咧开嘴巴，放肆地露出一口白牙。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
